{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國女神金裕貞今日以白色露肩裝現身台北出席品牌活動，談到新劇《百日謊言》大受台迷歡迎，她開心表示：「去年也曾到高雄，很高興知道這部劇受到大家喜愛，希望下次有機會能和粉絲有更多互動。</p><p>」她透露抵台後第一次品嘗台灣牛肉麵，令她念念不忘。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:22:33.424297+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.659114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.659114+00:00","content_hash":"ffbf77ff60c038adb47394a93ed156f5ed057123115f8f8648ec2f4998dffb15","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}